        "created_at": "2026-02-09T16:46:08.333Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Aw sheesh, they’re talking about a Turkish restaurant.  Episode 13.</p>\n<p>If Jed is vulnerable to jump scares, I’m surprised that he successfully climbs rocks in his spare time.  A lawyer being jump scareable, that makes sense.  A lawyer climbing rocks, that doesn’t not make sense.  But a jump scareable person climbing rocks, that sounds like a recipe for disaster.  Maybe his reaction to the scare is to freeze and grip tighter?  That could work, but I feel like most people by definition don’t do that when jump scared.  They’re more likely, methinks, to, well…jump.</p>\n<p>I would do Rock Lords, that’s super obvious imo.</p>",
